WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.129
In case you missed it, Marines in One Piece
have bounties now.

00:00:03.129 --> 00:00:07.960
That’s thanks to Mihawk’s &amp; Crocodile’s
newly formed Cross guild organization, that

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:13.000
pulled the ultimate uno reverse card and is
now putting money on the head’s of marines.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.760
So let’s try and predict what the bounty
of the top level marines will be.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.590
Starting with Luffy’s grandfather, vice
admiral Monkey D. Garp, known as the hero

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.609
of the marines.

00:00:23.609 --> 00:00:27.179
How much Garp is one of the oldest still active
Marines.

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:31.950
However, no one would make the mistake to
underestimate this man, even now.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:37.040
As father of the world’s most wanted criminal
Monkey D. Dragon and grandfather of the current

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:42.270
Yonko and future pirate king Monkey D. Luffy,
it’s no big surprise that Garp used to be

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.000
one of the strongest marines in history.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.810
He and fleet admiral Sengoku were the faces
of the Marine forces during the legendary

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:54.030
era of the likes of Gol D. Roger, Whitebeard
and Rocks D. Xebec.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:59.280
The only reason that Garp stayed only at vice
admiral level was because he repeatedly refused

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.430
a promotion to either admiral or fleet admiral.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:07.500
That’s because in these positions you are
at the direct disposal of the Celestial Dragons,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.300
the corrupt ruling class of One Piece, that
Garp himself despises.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:17.020
During his prime Garp regularly clashed with
the strongest pirates in One Piece history,

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:19.450
and was respected by all of them.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:24.270
Not only did he train Luffy as a kid, but
also the current generation of elite marine

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.070
fighters, such as Aokiji.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:30.570
And even though Garp is serving in more of
an advisory position at this point, we can

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:34.540
assume, that he is still one of the most powerful
marines in existence.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:39.750
After all, during the war at Marineford, Sengoku
had to stop him from attacking Akainu, seemingly

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:45.689
genuinely worried that Garp would kill the
strongest admiral after he killed ace.

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:48.619
So what’s his bounty going to be?

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:52.579
Now, we haven’t actually seen any of the
marines bounties officially yet, so there

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:56.040
is nothing we can anchor our estimate to.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:02.470
It seems that instead of a number the bounty
amounts are indicated by symbols.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:06.680
The once we’ve seen so far are two stars
three stars and a crown.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:12.010
I would assume that each symbol corresponds
to either a certain marine rank or a certain

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:17.290
amount of money.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:22.910
We also have no idea how much money Crocodile
and Mihawk actually have to finance these

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.910
marine bounties.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.830
It could be a lot less than regular pirate
bounties, given the world governments massive

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.520
financial resources.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:35.620
However we do know that Crossguild has a lot
of backing from the criminal underworld in

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:39.569
One Piece, so I think for the sake of this
video, let’s just assume that Buggy, Mihawk

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:43.860
and Crocodile have a lot of free cashflow
allocated to this project.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.830
And so let’s also assume that Marine bounties
and Pirate bounties are on the exact same

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:48.830
level.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.310
That makes them a lot easier to deduce and
compare.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.099
For Garp, that means that as a legend of the
marines who could fight with the likes of

00:02:55.099 --> 00:03:00.690
Roger, Whitebeard and Rocks, he would absolutely
be in the top tier of Marine bounties.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:05.840
So if we compare him to the bounties of these
legends, if I was Crocodile, I think it would

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:12.540
be fair to give Garp a 3 Billion berry bounty,
the same as his grandson Luffy.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.700
That reflects his power and former Glory,
but also factors in that he has grown old

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.730
and only receives his bounty now at 78 years
old.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:27.730
In terms of the cross guild poster, that could
be 3 crowns for instance.

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:32.401
In contrast to a legend like Garp, what would
be the bounty of someone like Luffy’s former

00:03:32.401 --> 00:03:34.260
Marine rival smoker?

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:38.640
The reason I find him a very interesting example
here, is because smoker went from a character

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:43.300
far more powerful than Luffy, to the point
where none of the straw hats could do anything

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:48.370
against him, to a marine we all would see
as relatively weak, especially after he got

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.959
completely humiliated by Doflamingo on Punk
Hazard.

00:03:51.959 --> 00:03:56.549
At some point, Luffy and in fact all of the
straw hats passed him in power.

00:03:56.549 --> 00:04:00.620
I would argue that this happened during the
timeskip, Luffy Zoro and Sanji learned Haki

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:06.110
and thus Smokers big advantage, his Logia
fruit, become irrelevant.

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:12.640
So even though Smoker is now a vice-admiral
like Garp, I would give him a bounty of 300

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:17.680
Million Berries, same as Luffy after defeating
Crocodile and a bit less than current Nami,

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.850
which I think is pretty much the best he could
hope for.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.280
Let’s compare that to the three current
admirals.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.670
Kizaru, Fujitora and Ryokugyuu are the top
3 strongest fighters in the Marines next to

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.750
Akainu right now.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:35.389
We actually don’t know if the admirals could
actually match a Yonko 1vs1, but they are

00:04:35.389 --> 00:04:38.669
pretty much the Marine equivalent to the emperors.

00:04:38.669 --> 00:04:43.759
Therefore i think they should have decently
high bounties, definitely in the billion berry

00:04:43.759 --> 00:04:44.759
range.

00:04:44.759 --> 00:04:49.040
From Crocodiles perspective, the lowest bounty
should go to Greenbull.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.610
Not only was he not exactly convincing with
his appearance in Wano, despite his incredible

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:59.970
awesome devil fruit, but Crocodile’s desert
logia powers are pretty much Greenbull’s

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:00.970
weakness.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:06.410
So overall, he is probably the admiral Cross
Guild needs to be the least worried about.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:11.070
Since he is an active admiral I would give
him a higher bounty than Garp, but a lower

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:16.540
one than Blackbeard, so 3.5 Billion berries
seems like a good number.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.740
Kizaru is a different beast.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:23.800
Despite his apparently lazy attitude, he is
always eager to face the strongest opponents

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.389
possible on his own.

00:05:25.389 --> 00:05:30.730
And we have already seen multiple times how
devastating and effective he can be.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.880
3.8 billion berries sounds like a good fit
for him.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:39.090
And now you may be surprised that Fujitora
gets the highest bounty out of all 3 of the

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:43.419
admirals, but remember that he was the one
who got rid of the warloard system in the

00:05:43.419 --> 00:05:49.069
first place and immediately started a hunt
for Crocodile Mihawk and co.

00:05:49.069 --> 00:05:55.289
For sure he will be the most focused on this
new group formed by former warloards and thus

00:05:55.289 --> 00:05:58.510
poses the biggest threat for Cross Guild.

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:02.069
If you take down Fujitora, you get 4 Billion
berries.

00:06:02.069 --> 00:06:06.330
Alternatively if you subscribe to the channel,
you get fresh, high quality one piece content

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.520
ever single week.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:12.650
Moving on to the only character that has had
an even more impressive glow up than Luffy

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.880
throughout one piece.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:17.319
The very first friend he makes in the story:
Koby.

00:06:17.319 --> 00:06:21.180
Now Koby might not seem like a major threat
at first glance, but that’s because you

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.669
know him as a friend of Luffy.

00:06:23.669 --> 00:06:26.490
Actually more fanboy than friend.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:31.650
But from an outside perspective, Koby grew
from a tiny 12 year old looking guy, into

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:34.530
a full grown man in just two years.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:40.080
He went from sweeping decks to a full blown
marine captain in record time.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:44.521
He has been personally trained by Garp, who
as you know trained the likes of Aokiji, he

00:06:44.521 --> 00:06:50.660
has mastered Haki, the techniques of the six
powers and is part of the secret marine organization

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.660
sword.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:58.129
Crocodile, Mihawk and Buggy saw Koby standing
up to Akainu during the marineford war and

00:06:58.129 --> 00:07:00.050
saw Shanks protecting him.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.160
And they might well know that he is aiming
to become an admiral himself.

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:09.380
So I think it’s more than reasonable to
give Koby the Hero, a bounty of at least 500

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.990
Million berries for his fast rise through
the ranks.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:17.290
His buddy helmeppo meanwhile I would give
250 million maybe, a bit less than smoker.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:21.550
Next we have one of the most mysterious characters
in the series: Kong.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:25.979
In case you don’t know who that is, it’s
because there is barely anything we know about

00:07:25.979 --> 00:07:31.370
this character, even though he is technically
the most important marine in One Piece.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:36.460
During Garp’s and Sengoku’s era, he was
the previous Fleet admiral, the highest rank

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.889
within the marines, until he got promoted.

00:07:38.889 --> 00:07:40.090
To what you ask?

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:44.729
Well, his current position is that of World
Government Commander in chief.

00:07:44.729 --> 00:07:50.470
In other words, the only people ranking higher
than Kong in the world are the five elders

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.310
and Imu themselves.

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:57.979
Kong not only has full control over the entire
Marine system, but also commands the government

00:07:57.979 --> 00:08:04.190
secret agencies, Enies Lobby and Impel Down,
and even the 7 warlords of the sea, when they

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.819
were still a thing.

00:08:05.819 --> 00:08:10.580
Sengoku had to come to his office to offer
his resignation as fleet admiral.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:16.530
And it was technically also Kong who officially
declared Akainu the new fleet admiral.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:21.250
While Sengoku and Garp lead the current generation
of top marines, Kong led the generation of

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.419
Sengoku and Garp.

00:08:22.419 --> 00:08:26.310
So we can only assume how powerful he must
be.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.949
Plus look at this man’s forearms and his
face scar.

00:08:28.949 --> 00:08:31.620
And he has a monkey theme, just like Luffy.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.570
So this dude knows how to fight.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:39.599
Similar to Garp and Sengoku, he is quite old,
but due to his strength and especially his

00:08:39.599 --> 00:08:45.950
political power, taking him out would truly
throw the entire world government into complete

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:46.950
chaos.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:52.149
So, I personally think that despite the little
we know about him, Kong deserves the second

00:08:52.149 --> 00:08:56.640
highest marine bounty of 4.5 billion berries.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:02.209
Because the highest Marine bounty will without
any doubt go to the scariest and as far as

00:09:02.209 --> 00:09:06.089
we know currently strongest Marine in One
Piece.

00:09:06.089 --> 00:09:09.820
Fleet admiral Sakazuki, formerly known as
Admiral Akainu.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.820
Akainu has been built up by Oda to be one
of the main villains of the story.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:19.250
He is the reason for both Luffy’s and Robin’s
deepest and darkest moment.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:24.959
He is the marine that goes hard against any
pirate, no matter the circumstance and as

00:09:24.959 --> 00:09:28.820
we know, he does have the power to back it
up.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:33.050
As the current fleet admiral, he is the head
of the marine forces, and even though Kong

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.950
is above him in rank, the story suggests that
there is no Marine that is more powerful than

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:39.950
him at the moment.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:46.430
As the biggest threat to Cross Guild and pirates
in general, Akainu deserves the highest bounty

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.640
out of all marines.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:52.100
I’m incredibly curious to find out how the
cross guild bounty system actually works and

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.230
how much each marine will be worth.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:10:00.360
But in the context of this video, I think
Akainu deserves a 4.8 billion berry bounty.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.339
With that he would also make it into the top
5 of the highest pirate bounties.

00:10:05.339 --> 00:10:10.170
If you want to know who is above him and all
remaining 1 billion plus bounties, you can

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.779
watch that video right here.

